					<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Our records indicate there is still a balance outstanding for utility service at the above service location. Please make payment in full or call our office to make arrangements by the due date of this letter to avoid referral to our collection agency. Reference the above account number on your check and on any correspondence to our office to insure accuracy.<br />"]]></textFieldExpression>
